# SHAHIN-E GATE 3 LEVEL CRUISE
# Brief: Gate 3 calibration of the Shahin-E model (gps_denied_navigation feature).
# Home = shahin_e_runway.sdf spherical coordinates. All legs on the home latitude (due East).
